# Template for local settings. Git tracks this file, so never put a real key here.
#
# Windows (PowerShell):  Copy-Item .env.example .env  then  notepad .env
# Linux:                 cp .env.example .env         then  edit .env
#
# Git ignores .env, and the commit hook blocks it. Do not paste a key into a chat, an issue, or a
# screenshot. If a key is ever exposed, revoke it in the DeepSeek console and create a new one.

# ---- DeepSeek ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Create a key at https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys and paste it after the = below.
AI_OPS_LLM_PROVIDER=deepseek
AI_OPS_LLM_API_KEY=

# Optional. The default is deepseek-flash. The other documented model is deepseek-v4-pro.
# AI_OPS_LLM_CHAT_MODEL=deepseek-v4-pro

# ---- Without a key ------------------------------------------------------------
# To run offline with the mock provider, use this line in place of the two above.
# AI_OPS_LLM_PROVIDER=mock

# All other settings are in docs/CONFIGURATION.md.
